<title>USA: Sigma Designs Inc Q3 net profit.</title>
<headline>Sigma Designs Inc Q3 net profit.</headline>
<dateline>FREMONT, Calif 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>(in thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>			   Three Months Ended     Nine Months Ended</p>
<p>				   October 31	     October 31</p>
<p>				 1996   1995(a)     1996(a)   1995(a)</p>
<p> Net Sales		$ 12,727 $  6,210    $ 37,249  $ 19,113</p>
<p> Net Income (Loss)     1,062  (1,522)	 1,307 (14,254)(b)</p>
<p>Net Income (Loss)</p>
<p>  per share		   0.09   (0.20)	  0.12    (1.89)</p>
<p>Shares used in</p>
<p>  computation	     11,441    7,643	11,075     7,556</p>
<p>(a) adjusted to include Active Design's net loss for the period.</p>
<p>(b) includes $8.3 million related to the write down of SDIS assets and inventory and other reserves.</p>
